5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a fair system. I want to check the complaint log and the morning departures to see how current habits affect us.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I’m worried the current spots don’t match where bikes actually park! I’ll check the sticker register and the rain exposure to see what’s really happening.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I’ll examine the morning departures and the rain exposure. The physical conditions and daily flow seem most critical to understand before we decide.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I’m checking the building account's two-year ledger and the treasurer's handover file. We need to know the actual costs before debating fairness.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I’ll review the five years of association minutes and the last year’s complaint log. I need to see how past duties actually collapsed.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Yumi, checking rain exposure is practical. I’m focusing on the complaint log and morning departures to understand the social friction and actual usage patterns.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, that sounds like a great plan! I’m really curious to see if the rain data matches the sticker register. Let’s hope we find a fair solution!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Yumi, I agree. Data on physical wear and daily congestion will ground our debate in reality rather than assumption.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Toshio, digging through five years of minutes? That’s a lot of dust. I’m just here to see if the money actually exists.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, Dust is cheap. I need to see where the work actually died.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, I understand the need for history. But I’m prioritizing immediate social friction. We must prevent the lobby from becoming a battleground.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Toshio, I hope the history helps us understand why things feel unfair! I’m just excited to see the real parking patterns.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, History explains the past, but it doesn’t fix the mud. I’m focused on the immediate physical reality of the rows.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, Mud is a maintenance cost. I’m checking the ledger to see if we can afford to fix it, or if we’re just talking.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, Money buys parts, not labor. I’m tracking who actually showed up to fix the last two lapses.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, Costs matter, but social collapse costs more. I’m done talking.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"@Shunichi, I hope the money is there! I’m done talking for now.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, Agreed. If the funds are missing, the physical fixes are moot. I’ll wait for the data.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Asuka, Social collapse is expensive, but so is ignorance. I’ll see what the ledger says.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
